{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日、mini×smartおしゃれ学園祭でミニライブをさせていただきました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/28/1489754/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもと違うステージで緊張しましたが、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさん暖かくて手を振ってくださったり、うれしかったです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/28/1489754/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それとランウェイを歩けたことに興奮しました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんな貴重な経験もできて、楽しかった〜(*^^*)♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"モデルさん方はみなさんスラッッとしてて身長高くてかっこよかったです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/28/1489754/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私はこの間測ったら159.9cmでした"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"160まであと1mm！おっ惜しい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「また大きくなったね〜」ってよく言われるけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中２からほとんど伸びてません(´・ω・｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんなすてきなイベントに呼んでもらえて、光栄でした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/28/1489754/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくださった方"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"声援ありがとうございました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/28/1489754/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなみと♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/28/1489754/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はい、TAKE１写メです　笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そういえば"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"奇跡が起きました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前回のアニメ0048の記事、投稿時間が00:48＼(^o^)／"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/28/1489754/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ねらった訳じゃなくてたまたまなんですよ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメントで教えてもらうまで気づきませんでした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/28/1489754/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごーい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"エリカ(。・∀・。)☆彡"}],"source":"archive"}